    <decisions>
        <description>If Broker is Snap Cap and AGS &gt; NF Snap Cap AGS limit, allow deal to continue. All other Brokers can continue. If deal does not Continue to Underwriting, set up the records required to send the deal to QuickBridge via API integration.</description>
        <name>Eligible_to_Continue</name>
        <label>Eligible to Continue</label>
        <locationX>604</locationX>
        <locationY>246</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Contact_Roles</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Route to QB - Snap</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Route_to_NF</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Opportunity_Record.Broker_Account__r.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Snap Capital LLC</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Opportunity_to_Statements_In</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Route to NF</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Route_to_NF_2</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND (2 OR 3)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Opportunity_Record.Broker_Account__r.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Snap Capital LLC</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Opportunity_Record.Annual_Revenue__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThanOrEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>formulaSnapCapAGSLimit</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Opportunity_Record.Annual_Revenue__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>LessThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <elementReference>formulaSnapCapAGSMin</elementReference>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Opportunity_to_Statements_In</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Route to NF - Snap</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>When a deal is submitted via the Broker API change the stage to Statements In. If the Broker is Snap Cap, only continue if the AGS submitted with the deal is &gt; Snap Cap AGS limit.</description>
